{"sha": "ffeae9f7836310f5850132d64bf8b0724c660b6d49a6dbe3cf16507e9a36ab51", "body": ["\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:series:4}", "研究 $\\sum \\dfrac{\\sin(n\\theta)}{n^\\alpha}$ 的收敛性", "（$\\theta \\in \\R$，$\\alpha > 0$） --- 对于哪些 $(\\theta, \\alpha)$，", "级数是绝对收敛、条件收敛，还是发散？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:series:5}", "（黎曼重排）设 $\\sum u_n$ 为收敛但非绝对收敛的实级数，", "且 $\\ell \\in \\R$。证明：", "$\\sum u_n$ 的某个重排收敛于 $\\ell$。", "\\emph{（说明正项子级数与负项子级数均发散；", "然后贪心地交替取项：先取正项，直至部分和超过", "$\\ell$，再取负项，直至部分和低于该数，如此反复；各项趋于", "$0$，由此迫使级数收敛于 $\\ell$。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:series:6}", "证明下述族", "$\\Bigl(\\dfrac{x^{m+n}}{m!\\,n!}\\Bigr)_{(m,n)\\in\\N^2}$ 对每个", "$x \\in \\R$ 可和，并重新推导恒等式 $(\\eu^x)^2 =", "\\eu^{2x}$，并沿对角线 $m + n =", "k$ 对二重和分组。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:series:7}", "证明族 $\\bigl(\\frac{1}{m^2 n^2}\\bigr)_{m,n \\geq 1}$", "可和，并按 $\\gcd$ 分组，记 $q = \\gcd(m,n)$，", "\\[", "\\zeta(2)^2 = \\sum_{q\\geq1} \\frac{1}{q^4}", "\\sum_{\\substack{a,b \\geq 1\\\\ \\gcd(a,b)=1}} \\frac{1}{a^2b^2}", "= \\zeta(4) \\cdot S,", "\\]", "其中 $S = \\sum_{\\gcd(a,b)=1} \\frac{1}{a^2b^2}$，由此推出 $S =", "\\zeta(2)^2/\\zeta(4)$。\\emph{（每个数对 $(m,n)$ 唯一地写成", "$(qa, qb)$，其中 $\\gcd(a,b) = 1$。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:series:8}", "（阿贝尔乘积定理，简化版）设 $\\sum a_n$", "绝对收敛，$\\sum b_n$ 收敛。证明：它们的", "柯西乘积 $\\sum c_n$ 收敛，且 $\\sum c_n = (\\sum", "a_n)(\\sum b_n)$。\\emph{（记 $C_N = \\sum_{k\\leq N} c_k = \\sum_n", "a_n B_{N-n}$，其中 $B$ 为 $b$ 的部分和；按", "$n \\leq N/2$ 是否成立分两种情形，利用 $(B_m)$ 的有界性及", "$(a_n)$ 的绝对收敛尾部。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:series:9}", "在（非完备的）空间 $E$ 中，其元素为最终为零的实数列，", "赋以上确界范数，试给出一个绝对收敛的级数，", "但在 $E$ 中不收敛。\\emph{（取 $u_n = 2^{-n} e_n$，其中 $(e_n)$ 为", "标准序列。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:series:10}", "验证恒等式 $\\arctan(n+1) - \\arctan(n) =", "\\arctan\\dfrac{1}{n^2 + n + 1}$，并由此求出下列和的精确值：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\arctan\\frac{1}{n^2 + n + 1} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:series:11}", "判断下列级数的敛散性（可利用等价量）：", "\\[", "\\sum_n \\bigl(\\sqrt{n+1} - \\sqrt n\\bigr)^{\\alpha}", "\\ (\\alpha > 0), \\qquad", "\\sum_n \\Bigl(1 - \\cos\\frac1n\\Bigr), \\qquad", "\\sum_n \\Bigl(\\eu - \\Bigl(1 + \\frac1n\\Bigr)^{\\!n}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:series:12}", "设 $(a_n)$ 为正且\\emph{递减}的数列，", "且 $\\sum a_n$ 收敛。证明 $n\\,a_n \\to 0$ \\emph{（用一段尾部", "控制 $n a_{2n}$）}。说明逆命题不成立，并说明单调性是", "本质的，并给出具体反例。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\section{问题：欧拉的 $\\zeta(2) = \\pi^2/6$，借助柯西的", "余切和}", "", "欧拉最著名的恒等式 $1 + \\frac14 + \\frac19 + \\cdots =", "\\frac{\\pi^2}6$，其证明完全初等，归功于", "柯西：由棣莫弗公式可得一多项式，其根为", "数 $\\cot^2\\frac{k\\pi}{2n+1}$，由韦达定理可精确求出这些根之和，", "并利用夹逼式 $\\cot^2\\theta < \\frac{1}{\\theta^2} <", "1 + \\cot^2\\theta$，将 $\\sum\\frac1{k^2}$ 的部分和夹在", "两个显式有理界之间。下面完整写出证明，", "并用同样方法推出 $\\zeta(4) = \\frac{\\pi^4}{90}$，再", "借助伯特兰级数刻画收敛与发散之间的整个", "分界 --- 并证明该分界上根本不存在", "最慢收敛的级数。", "", "\\begin{problem}[{周末问题 --- $\\zeta(2) = \\pi^2/6$ 与", "伯特兰全景}]", "\\label{pb:b2:series:1}", "全文设 $n \\geq 1$，$\\theta_k = \\dfrac{k\\pi}{2n+1}$，其中 $k", "= 1, \\dots, n$；注意 $0 < \\theta_k < \\frac\\pi2$。", "", "\\medskip", "\\noindent\\textbf{第一部分 --- 余切恒等式。}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 证明棣莫弗公式 $(\\cos\\theta +", "        \\iu\\sin\\theta)^m = \\cos m\\theta + \\iu\\sin m\\theta$（$m", "        \\in \\N$），并由此推出，对 $m = 2n + 1$，", "        \\[", "        \\sin\\bigl((2n{+}1)\\theta\\bigr) = \\sum_{j=0}^{n}", "        (-1)^j\\binom{2n+1}{2j+1}\\cos^{2(n-j)}\\theta\\,", "        \\sin^{2j+1}\\theta .", "        \\]", "  \\item 由此可得，对 $\\theta \\in \\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$，", "        \\[", "        \\sin\\bigl((2n{+}1)\\theta\\bigr) =", "        \\sin^{2n+1}\\theta\\; P_n(\\cot^2\\theta),", "        \\qquad", "        P_n(x) = \\sum_{j=0}^{n}", "        (-1)^j\\binom{2n+1}{2j+1}x^{\\,n-j},", "        \\]", "        一个次数为 $n$ 的多项式，首项系数为 $2n", "        + 1$。", "  \\item 证明 $x_k = \\cot^2\\theta_k$，$k = 1, \\dots, n$ 是", "        $n$ 个\\emph{互异}的 $P_n$ 的根 --- 从而即为全部", "        根。", "  \\item 由韦达定理，证明下列精确恒等式", "        \\[", "        \\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\cot^2\\frac{k\\pi}{2n+1}", "        = \\frac{n(2n-1)}{3}.", "        \\]", "  \\item 由此亦可得 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^{n}", "        \\frac{1}{\\sin^2\\theta_k} = \\frac{2n(n+1)}{3}$.", "  \\item 证明夹逼式：$\\cot^2\\theta < \\dfrac1{\\theta^2} <", "        \\dfrac{1}{\\sin^2\\theta}$，对 $\\theta \\in", "        \\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$，\\emph{（由 $\\sin\\theta < \\theta <", "        \\tan\\theta$）}。", "\\end{enumerate}", ""]}